@page "/floodreport"

<PageTitle>@FloodReportPages.Home.Title</PageTitle>

<GdsBreadcrumbs Items="[GeneralPages.Home.ToGdsBreadcrumb()]" />

<GdsHeading Level="1">@FloodReportPages.Home.Title</GdsHeading>

<p>Use this service to report flooding at your property to relevant organisations and groups.</p>
<p>The organisations who can help you during a flood depend on the type and location of the flooding.</p>
<p>By reporting a flood, you are helping communities to protect properties from flooding.</p>
<GdsWarning Text="Call 999 if you or someone else is in immediate danger." />

<GdsHeading Level="2">Before you start</GdsHeading>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
    <li>it is a legal requirement to report past flooding to potential buyers when selling a property</li>
    <li>if the flooding only affects a road please report it to the relevant highways authority</li>
    <li>filling out this form will assist with multi-agency flood response</li>
    <li>this will not trigger an immediate response from any agency</li>
    <li>you may be asked to provide an update to what happened at a later date</li>
</ul>
<p>Read our <GdsLink Href="@GeneralPages.Privacy.Url">@GeneralPages.Privacy.Title.ToLowerInvariant()</GdsLink> notice to find out how your personal data is used and shared.</p>

<div>
    <GdsStartButton Href="@FloodReportCreatePages.Home.Url" Text="Start now" />
</div>

<GdsHeading Level="2">Need help?</GdsHeading>
<div>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
        <li>for reporting or updating your flood, <GdsLink Href="https://www.gov.uk/find-local-council">contact your local authority</GdsLink></li>
        <li>for advice on how to deal with flooding, <GdsLink Href="#get-advice" >contact Floodline</GdsLink></li>
    </ul>

    <GdsHeading Level="3" id="get-advice">Get advice</GdsHeading>
    <GdsInsetText>
        <div><strong>Floodline helpline</strong></div>
        <div>Telephone: 0345 988 1188</div>
        <div>Textphone: 0345 602 6340</div>
        <div>Open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week</div>
        <div><GdsLink Href="https://www.gov.uk/call-charges" target="_blank">Find out more about call charges</GdsLink></div>
    </GdsInsetText>
</div>

<GdsHeading Level="2">Further information about flooding</GdsHeading>
<ul class="govuk-list">
    <li>
        <GdsLink Href="https://www.gov.uk/report-flood-cause">Report a flood or possible cause of flooding</GdsLink>
    </li>
</ul>
